  "solution": "TXĐ: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>ℝ</mi><mo>\\</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math><br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br>\n\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/a54b71387918bdf322f213bd8b0400021a500ade0b7ed82f7b8a11a89233c76e.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tTừ đó ta xét tính đúng sai của các khẳng định:\n\t\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Sai</li><li>Sai</li><li>Sai vì <br>\n\t\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br> Do đó hàm số đạt giá trị nhỏ nhất trên đoạn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>;</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math> bằng <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng vì<br>\n\t\t\tTa có: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tDo đó: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mo>±</mo><mi>∞</mi></mrow></munder><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tSuy ra hàm số có tiệm cận xiên là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math> hay <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
